---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SOCIALS } from '../consts';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About Kevin Kelchen, software engineer.">
  <h1 class="mb-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
    <p>
      I'm a full-stack software engineer with a frontend specialty, leading
      frontend architecture for cross-platform web and mobile with Angular,
      TypeScript, Ionic, and Capacitor. I'm passionate about software design and
      the art of applying principles, patterns, and practices to craft solutions
      that improve the lives of other people. I'm also excited about how modern
      AI tools are accelerating my day-to-day development work.
    </p>
    <p>
      For 10 years, I've served as the frontend architect of an enterprise SaaS
      mobile/desktop app. As a cross-team technical leader, I've been a
      force-multiplier enabling my teams to deliver on key business objectives
      while keeping the architecture maintainable, extensible, and a pleasure to
      work with.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm a seasoned creator of CI/CD processes, designer of REST APIs, and
      initiator of side-projects as a means of learning and applying innovative
      technology to improve products and tools.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm also experienced building teams through hiring, onboarding, and
      mentoring. I've given talks and provided training workshops.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of software, I find fulfillment in serving my community,
      motorcycling, and enjoying the vibes of the 80s and 90s.
    </p>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is on <a href={SOCIALS.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a> or <a href={SOCIALS.x}>X</a>. My code lives on <a href={SOCIALS.github}>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
